./ R 00197000 00198000 $ 00197100 100                                           
*  SRL R3,28 TOOK SEGPLEN FROM BITS 0-3 AND THE NEXT CARD      XA0036DK         
*  ADDED ONE. PTL IS BITS 28-31 IN UNITS OF 16 ENTRIES.        XA0036DK         
         N     R3,=A(SEGPTLF) NUMBER OF PTES                   XA0036DK         
         LA    R3,1(,R3)      UNITS OF 16 ENTRIES              XA0036DK         
         SLL   R3,4           PAGES IN THIS SEGMENT            XA0036DK         
./ R 00289000          $ 00289100 100                                           
*  WAS SRL R2,16 -- THE 64 KB SEGMENT NUMBER. THE NEXT CARD'S  XA0036DK         
*  SLL R2,2 IS RIGHT IN BOTH ARCHITECTURES, SINCE AN STE IS A  XA0036DK         
*  FULLWORD IN BOTH; ONLY THE SHIFT THAT ISOLATES THE SEGMENT  XA0036DK         
*  NUMBER MOVES, 16 TO 20. THE THREE CARDS AT 00291000 BELOW,  XA0036DK         
*  WHICH THIS DECK ALREADY REPLACED, FORM THE ADDRESS THIS     XA0036DK         
*  INDEX GOES INTO -- I-162: THE GROUP WAS CONVERTED AND ITS   XA0036DK         
*  FIRST MEMBER WAS NOT.                                       XA0036DK         
         SRL   R2,20          SEGMENT NO. ONLY                 XA0036DK         
./ R 00291000          $ 00291100 100                                           
         L     R6,VMSEG       THE DESIGNATION                  XA0036DK         
         N     R6,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH               XA0036DK         
         ALR   R2,R6          ADDR OF SEGTABLE ENTRY           XA0036DK         
./ R 00294000          $ 00294100 100                                           
         S     R2,=A(PAGPFRA-PAGSTMP) BACKUP TO HEADER         XA0036DK         
./ R 00298000          $ 00298100 100                                           
*  WAS N R1,F15 -- A PAGE NUMBER WITHIN A SIXTEEN-PAGE         XA0036DK         
*  SEGMENT. THE SRL 12 ABOVE IS RIGHT IN BOTH ARCHITECTURES    XA0036DK         
*  AND THE SLL 3 BELOW IS AN EIGHT-BYTE SWPTABLE ENTRY, ALSO   XA0036DK         
*  UNCHANGED; ONLY THE NUMBER OF PAGES A SEGMENT HOLDS MOVED.  XA0036DK         
*  DMKPGS 01010000 IS THE SAME CARD AND ALREADY READS F255.    XA0036DK         
*  BOTH F15 AND F255 ARE DEFINED IN PSA.MACRO, SO NOTHING      XA0036DK         
*  ELSE HAS TO BE DECLARED.                                    XA0036DK         
         N     R1,F255        PAGE NO. WITHIN SEGMENT          XA0036DK         
./ R 00335000          $ 00335100 100                                           
*  WAS SRL R2,16. SAME CHANGE AS 00289000, IN REBRANGE RATHER  XA0036DK         
*  THAN NXTRANGE -- THE TWO LOOPS ARE NEAR-DUPLICATES.         XA0036DK         
         SRL   R2,20          SEGMENT NUMBER ONLY              XA0036DK         
./ R 00337000          $ 00337100 100                                           
         L     R6,VMSEG       THE DESIGNATION                  XA0036DK         
         N     R6,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH               XA0036DK         
         ALR   R2,R6          ADDR OF SEGMENT ENTRY            XA0036DK         
