./ R 00512000 00513000 $ 00512100 100                                           
         N     R3,=A(SEGPTLF) NUMBER OF PTES                   XA0036DK         
         LA    R3,1(,R3)      UNITS OF 16 ENTRIES              XA0036DK         
         SLL   R3,4           PAGES IN THIS SEGMENT            XA0036DK         
