./ R 00614000          $ 00614100 100                                           
*  STCM KEPT BYTE 0, WHICH HELD SEGPLEN. THE FLAGS ARE BITS    XA0036DK         
*  26-31 NOW, SO THE ENTRY IS REBUILT FROM THE OLD FLAGS AND   XA0036DK         
*  THE NEW ORIGIN.                                             XA0036DK         
         L     R15,SEGPTO     THE CURRENT ENTRY                XA0036DK         
         N     R15,=A(SEGFLGM) KEEP I, C AND PTL               XA0036DK         
         OR    R15,R1         WITH THE NEW ORIGIN              XA0036DK         
         ST    R15,SEGPTO     UPDATE SEGTABLE ENTRY            XA0036DK         
./ R 00615000          $ 00615100 100                                           
         OI    SEGPTO+3,SEGINVAL MARK ENTRY AS INVALID         XA0036DK         
./ R 00623000          $ 00623100 100                                           
         USING PAGPFRA,R1                                      XA0036DK         
